# `.env` JAAN-BUJH KAR commit hoti hai — usme sirf backend ka pata hai,
# koi raaz nahi.
#
# Aur usme raaz rakhna chahiye bhi nahi: Vite har `VITE_*` variable ko
# build ke waqt JavaScript ke andar chipka deta hai, yaani woh har us
# aadmi ko dikhti hai jo panel kholta hai. Secret backend ki .env me
# rehte hain, yahan nahi.
#
# Local machine par alag pata chahiye to `.env.local` banaiye — woh
# ignore hoti hai aur `.env` se upar jaati hai.
.env.local
.env.*.local
